<!--
cspell:disable
Lovelace markdown card: "Why This Mode" — dashboard `sig-predbat-debug`,
views[0] ("Solar") / sections[2] / cards[1].

RECORD ONLY — this file is not loaded by HA. The card lives in Lovelace
storage; edit it with ha_config_set_dashboard(python_transform=...) and update
this file in the same change, so the repo stays the source of truth.

views[3] ("Archive (old layout)") holds an older copy that still renders
`headroom_short_pct` ("short N% room"). Left alone deliberately — it is
labelled as the archive. Do not "fix" it and do not treat it as a second live
site.

2026-08-11 — three lines were lying:
  * session reserve advertised 43.0% held while 0% was held (the plugin now
    publishes the EFFECTIVE reserve; the `{% if sesspct %}` guard then hides
    the line by itself)
  * "overflow fits — nothing at risk" was re-derived from `pv_at_risk_kwh`
    instead of reading `risk_verdict`, which is published for exactly this
    purpose — so it printed the reassuring branch while the plugin said
    "too early" and headroom was short
  * "sky tracking below p10 (0%)" showed the clamped percentile, which
    saturates at the extremes and says nothing; now a signed kWh delta
-->
{% set ip = 'sensor.predbat_curtailment_intended_policy' %}
{% set a = state_attr(ip, 'reason') %}
{% set mode = states(ip) %}
{% set live = states('input_select.sig_dispatch_policy') %}
{% set ov = states('input_select.sig_override') %}
{% set overriding = ov not in ['Off', 'unknown', 'unavailable', ''] %}
{% set soc = state_attr(ip, 'soc_pct') %}
{% set lo = state_attr(ip, 'charge_below_pct') %}
{% set hi = state_attr(ip, 'drain_above_pct') %}
{% set onight = state_attr(ip, 'overnight_target_pct') %}
{% set risk = state_attr(ip, 'pv_at_risk_kwh') %}
{% set verdict = state_attr(ip, 'risk_verdict') %}
{% set ovr = state_attr(ip, 'override_label') %}
{% set src = state_attr(ip, 'drain_above_source') %}
{% set srclabel = state_attr(ip, 'drain_above_source_label') %}
{% set sesspct = state_attr(ip, 'session_reserve_pct') %}
{% set sessstart = state_attr(ip, 'session_start') %}
{% set sessdisp = state_attr(ip, 'session_dispatch') %}
{% set ph = 'sensor.predbat_curtailment_phase' %}
{% set trk = state_attr(ph, 'tracking_band') %}
{% set pvact = state_attr(ph, 'pv_actual_kwh') %}
{% set pvexp = state_attr(ph, 'pv_expected_p50_kwh') %}
{% set sessend = state_attr(ip, 'session_end_soc_pct') %}
{% set sesstime = (sessstart | as_datetime | as_local).strftime('%H:%M') if sessstart else '' %}
{% set held = relative_time(states[ip].last_changed) if states[ip] is not none else '?' %}
{% set stale_s = (now() - (states[ip].last_reported or states[ip].last_updated)).total_seconds() if states[ip] is not none else 0 %}
### → {{ ov if overriding else mode }}
*{{ a }}*

{% if overriding %}✋ **You set this**
{% elif sessdisp %}⚡ **saving session** · heartbeat dispatching at the cap · {{ held }}
{% if sessend is not none %}   ↳ ends at ~**{{ sessend | round(0) }}%**
{% endif %}
{% else %}Live **{{ live }}**{% if live != mode and stale_s < 360 %} · ⏳ not applied{% elif live != mode %} · ⏳ awaiting next cycle{% endif %} · {{ held }}
{% endif %}
{% if stale_s > 660 %}⚠ **stale {{ (stale_s / 60) | round(0) }} min**
{% endif %}
{% if not overriding and not state_attr(ip,'acting') %}⚠ **not acting** — policy gate off
{% endif %}
{% if soc is not none %}
**{{ soc | round(0) }}%**{% if lo is not none and hi is not none %} · band **{{ lo | round(0) }}–{{ hi | round(0) }}%**
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if lo is not none %}↑ charge if below **{{ lo | round(1) }}%** (P10 recovery floor)
{% endif %}
{% if onight is not none %}🌙 overnight target **{{ onight | round(1) }}%** (tonight's need)
{% endif %}
{% if hi is not none %}↓ drain if above **{{ hi | round(0) }}%** ({{ srclabel or 'headroom floor' }})
{% endif %}
{% if sesspct %}⚡ **{{ sesspct | round(1) }}%** held for the {{ sesstime }} saving session{% if src != 'session_protect' %} (inside the charge floor){% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if trk in ['below p10', 'p10-p50', 'p50-p90', 'above p90'] %}🔭 sky tracking **{{ trk }}**{% if pvact is not none and pvexp is not none %} ({{ '%+.1f' | format(pvact - pvexp) }} kWh vs forecast){% endif %}
{% elif trk in ['too early', 'no spread'] %}🔭 sky tracking — {{ trk }}
{% endif %}
{% if verdict == 'at risk' %}⚠ **{{ risk | round(1) }} kWh at risk** — run a load to use it
{% elif verdict == 'fits' %}✓ overflow fits — nothing at risk
{% elif verdict == 'too early' %}⏳ overflow verdict — too early to call
{% endif %}
